silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_01_sections_04_concrete_anchor_7#mediatingarrow silm:hasLongDescription "The MediatingArrow is the unique mediating arrow into Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'u', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
